* SenderCreator
** Purpose
*** Neutral relay for initCode
*** msg.sender to factory is not EntryPoint
*** Holds no funds, no privileges
** Functions
*** createSender(initCode)
**** 20 bytes factory + calldata
**** returns sender or address(0)
*** initEip7702Sender(sender, data)
**** added in v0.8
**** inits an EIP-7702 account
** Used by EntryPoint
*** handleOps -> _createSenderIfNeeded
*** getSenderAddress (dry run)
**** reverts SenderAddressResult
**** off-chain via eth_call
** Used by others
*** Bundlers, SDKs, dApps
*** Learn counterfactual address
*** v0.8+: must go through getSenderAddress
** Version history
*** v0.6 / v0.7: no access control
*** v0.8: entryPoint check + 7702
*** v0.9: NotFromEntryPoint error
** EIP-7702 caveat
*** No factory, no CREATE2
*** getSenderAddress not applicable
@endmindmap
